{"game": "the-anacrusis", "language": "english", "appid": 1120480, "month": "2026-04", "window": 1, "start_date": 1775001600, "end_date": 1777593599, "month_true_total": 6, "quota": 6, "returned": 6, "pulled_at": "2026-09-03 00:45:47 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "224008029", "author": {"steamid": "76561198834014417", "personaname": "Obsolete", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198834014417/", "num_games_owned": 554, "num_reviews": 469, "playtime_forever": 131, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 17, "last_played": 1777104833, "avatar": "5c46b85f064ffe75e490571eaf72adee4610d3dd"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's an ok game.", "timestamp_created": 1777064571, "timestamp_updated": 1777064571, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1642097723", "hardware": {"system_ram": "7886", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "11th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i3-1115G4 @ 3.00GHz", "adapter_description": "Intel(R) UHD Graphics", "vram_size": 128}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "223604136", "author": {"steamid": "76561197997746595", "personaname": "Krimso", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Krimshun/", "num_games_owned": 787, "num_reviews": 134, "playtime_forever": 96, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 96, "last_played": 1776619911, "avatar": "52ac0f17cbaf8b37a3fc89b55ed6e0cbab517f2d"}, "language": "english", "review": "A Left 4 Dead space clone. I like it but seems no one is online, and I had to play with bots at most two other people. The menu isnt that great, and some glitches had me across the room. Sure its a $10 game but if no one is playing its best go play Left 4 Dead or Back 4 Blood.", "timestamp_created": 1776587425, "timestamp_updated": 1776619946, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.486983150243759155", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1642097723", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 25, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "223408047", "author": {"steamid": "76561198042735130", "personaname": "bijo2222🟣", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/osmposm/", "num_games_owned": 369, "num_reviews": 33, "playtime_forever": 371, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 147, "last_played": 1777081360, "avatar": "214a3757a9a6c3efc7c54be6d6f7c0372a3e4e99"}, "language": "english", "review": "i really like this coming from somebody who has put in many many l4d hours over xbox and pc. it is a little wonky and lacks the polish that shows where many bigger companies flourish . . . with reasonable expectations, i do believe this one is amazing. i got this very very cheap, but full price would not have disappointed me.\n\nif u have 1-3 friends to play w/ u, it is worth a try. it is silly, funky, entertaining and sometrimes thought provoking? there is some interesting sci-fi backstory around all of this. unfortunately, there consistently feels like huge chunks of story, backsetting, polish and what not prevent development of any extreme passion.\n\n\n", "timestamp_created": 1776385328, "timestamp_updated": 1776385328, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1642097723", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "223112287", "author": {"steamid": "76561198084415485", "personaname": "Coffee inside a bag of coffee", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/POOTISPENSERHEREPLZ/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 355, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 355, "last_played": 1776003631, "avatar": "40bf29a0a7d3e4a36e64456677985317e46ff3de"}, "language": "english", "review": "The Anacrusis is honestly the closest any game has gotten to replicating the enjoyment I get from playing Left 4 Dead 2. The characters are fun and the game has a nice atmosphere. There's taunts, which I wish were a thing in L4D. The workshop support also adds some replayability, which is always good.\n\nThe game does have its problems, though. The weapons feel weak an samey, the enemies tend to bunch up to the point where they feel less like individual targets and more like moving blobs, and there's a distinct lack of audio cues. Enemies like the Spawner and Flasher just hide in some unreachable place while hindering gameplay, and Eggs are always placed directly in your path, making almost every encounter with them exactly the same.\n\nEven though The Anacrusis is flawed, it is still charming. The skill floor is as high as the ceiling, so it's very easy to get into, but at the same time there's not much to keep you drawn in. It's fun to go back to every now and then, but overall pretty unpolished.", "timestamp_created": 1776005700, "timestamp_updated": 1776005852, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.533527672290802002", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1642097723", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "222954254", "author": {"steamid": "76561198029223935", "personaname": "Bone", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/BoneDips/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 31, "playtime_forever": 233, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 233, "last_played": 1660254962, "avatar": "ed3255c80e1600d5b7718b8ff824eb4b5ed667e6"}, "language": "english", "review": "nah", "timestamp_created": 1775838140, "timestamp_updated": 1775838140, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.477718830108642578", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1642097723", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "222518925", "author": {"steamid": "76561198271966973", "personaname": "Doraen", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198271966973/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 63, "playtime_forever": 258, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 258, "last_played": 1775328576, "avatar": "046d5c665e6a2de206c4d26d2b940c6a10cd6583"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's a marathon to make this game. Even though it's short, it's boring to death.\nIt's a Left 4 Dead for children: Without gore, without blood, without fear, without players. It's empty of everything.", "timestamp_created": 1775329057, "timestamp_updated": 1775329057, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 9, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.478747159242630005", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1642097723", "reactions": []}]}